                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1967–69, POL 27 CYP. Confidential. Drafted by Helman and cleared by McGuire
                    and Brandt on December 4. The memorandum
                    is Part III of IV. Parts I, II, and IV are ibid. The meeting took place at the
                        U.S. Mission to NATO.</p>
            </note>
